; A windtrap suite over the mutation runtime. The runtime's independence
; from the windtrap core is a property of lib/mutate; the suite itself
; dogfoods windtrap. arm_child stands in for an instrumented executable,
; exercising registration, arming from WINDTRAP_MUTATE_ARM and the
; runaway budget end to end in a separate process. The verdict file's
; suite is test/mutate_verdicts, beside the module it moved to. Nothing
; here writes under _build/_mutants: every path the suite writes to
; lives in a private scratch directory removed at exit.

(executable
 (name arm_child)
 (modules arm_child)
 (libraries windtrap_mutate))

(test
 (name test_mutate)
 (modules test_mutate)
 (libraries windtrap windtrap_mutate unix)
 (deps arm_child.exe))
